Craftsman
Copyright (c) 2026 Rafał Buczyński

Make AI coding agents prove they reviewed and tested their change.

This software includes:
- Quality gate and review verification runtime (`craftsman/`).
- Lifecycle hook scripts and adapters for Claude Code, GitHub Copilot, and Google Antigravity.
- Curated software engineering review skills and agent templates.
- Test suites and benchmarks.

